OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAEleanor Donaldson given
OL,4,Asupervision order and placed on sex
OL,5,Aoffenders' register
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe wife of former Democratic Unionist
OL,8,FParty (DUP) leader and convicted child
OL,9,Fsex offender Jeffrey Donaldson has been
OL,10,Fplaced under a supervision order for
OL,11,Fthree years.
OL,13,FAppearing before Newry Crown Court, via
OL,14,Fvideo link, for the first time since
OL,15,F2025, a tearful Eleanor Donaldson was
OL,16,Falso told she would be placed on the
OL,17,Fsex offenders' register for five years.
OL,19,FWhen Judge Paul Ramsey asked if she
OL,20,Funderstood that she would be subjected
OL,21,Fto a supervision treatment order (STO),
OL,22,Fshe nodded her head and said "yes".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
