OL,4,Asupervision order and placed on sex
OL,5,Aoffenders' register
OL,6,
OL,7,FEleanor Donaldson could not be given a
OL,8,Fprison sentence as she faced a 'trial
OL,9,Fof the facts' as it was determined she
OL,10,Fwas medically unfit for a criminal
OL,11,Ftrial.
